<title>UK: CRICKET-GLOUCESTERSHIRE 318-7 V AUSTRALIA (249) - TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-GLOUCESTERSHIRE 318-7 V AUSTRALIA (249) - TEA.</headline>
<dateline>BRISTOL, England 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gloucestershire, replying to Australia's total of 249, were 318 for seven at tea on the second day of their three-day tour match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 249 all out, Gloucestershire 318-7.</p>
